the xjc and WSDL2Java generators create classes with the same name and same packages according to the xsd.
This can't be used as is, therefore we use this generator to adjust the packges of the classes
so that they don't clash.

also, this cartridge makes entities serializable:

xjc unfortunately has no easy way to generate serializable classes. (only through
xjb binding configurations in the schema itself, which I don't want to touch).
This cartridge simply makes those generated entities serializable. Note that
it only works on those xjc-generated entities.

